    "whatDoes": "<strong>9 engineering skills:</strong> diagnose (debug loop: reproduce→minimise→hypothesise→instrument→fix→regression-test), grill-with-docs (grilling com shared language + CONTEXT.md + ADRs), triage (state machine de issues), improve-codebase-architecture (refactoring opportunities), tdd (red-green-refactor), to-issues (plan→issues vertical slices), to-prd (conversation→PRD), zoom-out (context overview), prototype (throwaway prototype).<br><br><strong>4 productivity skills:</strong> caveman (compressão de output 75%), grill-me (grilling interview), handoff (compactar conversa pra outro agente), teach (ensinar skill em múltiplas sessões), write-a-skill (criar skills).<br><br><strong>3 misc skills:</strong> git-guardrails-claude-code, migrate-to-shoehorn, setup-pre-commit, scaffold-exercises, setup (scaffold per-repo config).<br><br><strong>Setup:</strong> <code>npx skills@latest add mattpocock/skills</code>. Roda <code>/setup-matt-pocock-skills</code> pra configurar issue tracker, labels, docs path.",
