    "whatDoes": "• <strong>Dolt-Powered:</strong> SQL versionado com merge cell-level, branching nativo, sync via Dolt remotes<br>• <strong>Agent-Optimized:</strong> JSON output, dependency tracking, auto-ready detection<br>• <strong>Hash IDs:</strong> IDs baseados em hash (bd-a1b2) — zero conflito em multi-agent<br>• <strong>Compaction:</strong> \"memory decay\" semântico — sumariza tasks fechadas antigas<br>• <strong>Graph Links:</strong> relates_to, duplicates, supersedes, replies_to — grafo de conhecimento<br>• <strong>Messaging:</strong> tipo issue com threading (--thread), ciclo de vida efêmero<br>• <strong>Epics hierárquicos:</strong> bd-a3f8 → bd-a3f8.1 → bd-a3f8.1.1<br>• <strong>Stealth Mode:</strong> usa sem commitar no repo (--stealth)<br>• <strong>OpenCode:</strong> CLI independente (não é plugin). Roda como MCP server ou comando shell",
